    <briefdescription>
<para>Self-contained in-memory implementation of the LLM Wiki plugin interface. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Uses a simple hash-based score (sum of char values mod 1000 / 1000.0f) as a stand-in for real BM25+HNSW scoring. This is sufficient to validate lifecycle contracts, threading safety, and edition gating without requiring a real RocksDB or embedding model. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
